{"number":96,"name":"سُورَةُ العَلَقِ","englishName":"Al-Alaq","englishNameTranslation":"The Clot","numberOfAyahs":19,"items":[{"id":"q:96:1","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":96,"ayah":1,"surahName":"Al-Alaq","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ ٱقْرَأْ بِٱسْمِ رَبِّكَ ٱلَّذِى خَلَقَ","en":"Recite in the name of your Lord who created -","bn":"পাঠ করুন আপনার পালনকর্তার নামে যিনি সৃষ্টি করেছেন","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/96/1"},{"id":"q:96:2","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":96,"ayah":2,"surahName":"Al-Alaq","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"خَلَقَ ٱلْإِنسَٰنَ مِنْ عَلَقٍ","en":"Created man from a clinging substance.","bn":"সৃষ্টি করেছেন মানুষকে জমাট রক্ত থেকে।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/96/2"},{"id":"q:96:3","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":96,"ayah":3,"surahName":"Al-Alaq","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"ٱقْرَأْ وَرَبُّكَ ٱلْأَكْرَمُ","en":"Recite, and your Lord is the most Generous -","bn":"পাঠ করুন, আপনার পালনকর্তা মহা দয়ালু,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/96/3"},{"id":"q:96:4","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":96,"ayah":4,"surahName":"Al-Alaq","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"ٱلَّذِى عَلَّمَ بِٱلْقَلَمِ","en":"Who taught by the pen -","bn":"যিনি কলমের সাহায্যে শিক্ষা দিয়েছেন,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/96/4"},{"id":"q:96:5","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":96,"ayah":5,"surahName":"Al-Alaq","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"عَلَّمَ ٱلْإِنسَٰنَ مَا لَمْ يَعْلَمْ","en":"Taught man that which he knew not.","bn":"শিক্ষা দিয়েছেন মানুষকে যা সে জানত না।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/96/5"},{"id":"q:96:6","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":96,"ayah":6,"surahName":"Al-Alaq","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"كَلَّآ إِنَّ ٱلْإِنسَٰنَ لَيَطْغَىٰٓ","en":"No! [But] indeed, man transgresses","bn":"সত্যি সত্যি মানুষ সীমালংঘন করে,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/96/6"},{"id":"q:96:7","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":96,"ayah":7,"surahName":"Al-Alaq","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"أَن رَّءَاهُ ٱسْتَغْنَىٰٓ","en":"Because he sees himself self-sufficient.","bn":"এ কারণে যে, সে নিজেকে অভাবমুক্ত মনে করে।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/96/7"},{"id":"q:96:8","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":96,"ayah":8,"surahName":"Al-Alaq","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"إِنَّ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ ٱلرُّجْعَىٰٓ","en":"Indeed, to your Lord is the return.","bn":"নিশ্চয় আপনার পালনকর্তার দিকেই প্রত্যাবর্তন হবে।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/96/8"},{"id":"q:96:9","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":96,"ayah":9,"surahName":"Al-Alaq","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"أَرَءَيْتَ ٱلَّذِى يَنْهَىٰ","en":"Have you seen the one who forbids","bn":"আপনি কি তাকে দেখেছেন, যে নিষেধ করে","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/96/9"},{"id":"q:96:10","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":96,"ayah":10,"surahName":"Al-Alaq","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"عَبْدًا إِذَا صَلَّىٰٓ","en":"A servant when he prays?","bn":"এক বান্দাকে যখন সে নামায পড়ে?","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/96/10"},{"id":"q:96:11","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":96,"ayah":11,"surahName":"Al-Alaq","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"أَرَءَيْتَ إِن كَانَ عَلَى ٱلْهُدَىٰٓ","en":"Have you seen if he is upon guidance","bn":"আপনি কি দেখেছেন যদি সে সৎপথে থাকে।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/96/11"},{"id":"q:96:12","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":96,"ayah":12,"surahName":"Al-Alaq","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"أَوْ أَمَرَ بِٱلتَّقْوَىٰٓ","en":"Or enjoins righteousness?","bn":"অথবা খোদাভীতি শিক্ষা দেয়।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/96/12"},{"id":"q:96:13","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":96,"ayah":13,"surahName":"Al-Alaq","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"أَرَءَيْتَ إِن كَذَّبَ وَتَوَلَّىٰٓ","en":"Have you seen if he denies and turns away -","bn":"আপনি কি দেখেছেন, যদি সে মিথ্যারোপ করে ও মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয়।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/96/13"},{"id":"q:96:14","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":96,"ayah":14,"surahName":"Al-Alaq","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"أَلَمْ يَعْلَم بِأَنَّ ٱللَّهَ يَرَىٰ","en":"Does he not know that Allah sees?","bn":"সে কি জানে না যে, আল্লাহ দেখেন?","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/96/14"},{"id":"q:96:15","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":96,"ayah":15,"surahName":"Al-Alaq","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"كَلَّا لَئِن لَّمْ يَنتَهِ لَنَسْفَعًۢا بِٱلنَّاصِيَةِ","en":"No! If he does not desist, We will surely drag him by the forelock -","bn":"কখনই নয়, যদি সে বিরত না হয়, তবে আমি মস্তকের সামনের কেশগুচ্ছ ধরে হেঁচড়াবই-","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/96/15"},{"id":"q:96:16","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":96,"ayah":16,"surahName":"Al-Alaq","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"نَاصِيَةٍۢ كَٰذِبَةٍ خَاطِئَةٍۢ","en":"A lying, sinning forelock.","bn":"মিথ্যাচারী, পাপীর কেশগুচ্ছ।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/96/16"},{"id":"q:96:17","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":96,"ayah":17,"surahName":"Al-Alaq","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"فَلْيَدْعُ نَادِيَهُۥ","en":"Then let him call his associates;","bn":"অতএব, সে তার সভাসদদেরকে আহবান করুক।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/96/17"},{"id":"q:96:18","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":96,"ayah":18,"surahName":"Al-Alaq","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"سَنَدْعُ ٱلزَّبَانِيَةَ","en":"We will call the angels of Hell.","bn":"আমিও আহবান করব জাহান্নামের প্রহরীদেরকে","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/96/18"},{"id":"q:96:19","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":96,"ayah":19,"surahName":"Al-Alaq","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"كَلَّا لَا تُطِعْهُ وَٱسْجُدْ وَٱقْتَرِب ۩","en":"No! Do not obey him. But prostrate and draw near [to Allah].","bn":"কখনই নয়, আপনি তার আনুগত্য করবেন না। আপনি সেজদা করুন ও আমার নৈকট্য অর্জন করুন।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/96/19"}]}